                    chart_heading:          `Trust, Backlog Relief & Governance Trajectory`,
                    chart_start:            `Baseline`,
                    coach_header:           `Oversight Committee & Citizen Voice (facilitator)`,
                    coach_intro:            `The neighbouring canton's benefits algorithm just collapsed in a discrimination inquiry — on data that looks like yours. Parliament wants a responsible AI plan this quarter: clear the backlog, cut the wait, and do not repeat the failure next door. You hold 72% public trust. It is the most valuable thing on your balance sheet and the easiest to spend by accident. Prioritise, safeguard, sequence — and be ready to defend it in the language of legitimacy, not just speed.`,

